{"code":"093380","name":"풍강","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"자동차부품","sector_desc":"완성차에 들어가는 부품 제조. 완성차 생산량과 전동화(EV) 전환 속도, 환율의 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 1974년 너트, 볼트 및 스크류의 제조·판매를 목적으로 설립되었으며, 2007년 코스닥시장에 상장됨. 종속회사로 피케이메카트로닉스, SPM AUTO PARTS(멕시코), PUNGKANG AMERICA(미국) 등 3개사를 보유하고 있음. 현재 자동차조립용 부품을 제조·판매하며, 현대자동차, 기아, 한국지엠, 르노코리아 등 국내 완성차업체와 1차협력업체에 공급하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-23","n_days":300,"close":2710.0,"open":2720.0,"high":2725.0,"low":2620.0,"volume":8358,"amount":22650180.0,"ret_1d":-9.5159,"gap":-9.182,"range_pct":3.8745,"ret_5":5.4475,"ret_20":-13.0016,"ret_60":1.4981,"ret_120":-0.9141,"ret_250":-9.2127,"ma20":2950.5,"ma60":2941.5833,"ma120":2750.8333,"ma200":2738.8,"close_vs_ma200":-1.0516,"close_vs_ma60":-7.8727,"ma_align":1,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":41.2087,"r2_60":0.1318,"slope_120":51.5228,"r2_120":0.3298,"slope_250":0.974,"r2_250":0.0014,"high52":3395.0,"low52":2025.0,"pos_52w":50.0,"dd_52w":-20.1767,"mdd_1y":-31.5789,"atr14_pct":11.4128,"vol_ann_60":60.3941,"vol_avg20":25413.2,"vol_ratio20":0.3289,"vr5":0.3383,"vr20":0.5893,"amount_avg5":25807447.0,"amount_avg20":78223686.75,"amount_avg60":76382241.0,"obv_chg20":32.9836,"turnover_20":5.1447,"pv_eff_20":-2.5272,"rsi14":42.6867,"frgn_net_5":2448.0,"inst_net_5":-741.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0248,"inst_net_5_pct":-0.0075,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0173,"frgn_net_20":-2784.0,"inst_net_20":7055.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0282,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0714,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0432,"frgn_net_60":-20642.0,"inst_net_60":16490.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.2089,"inst_net_60_pct":0.1669,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.042,"frgn_net_120":-13848.0,"inst_net_120":21349.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.1402,"inst_net_120_pct":0.2161,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0759,"foreign_ratio":0.81,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.62,"smart_buy_streak":2,"op_income_q":15.0,"op_margin_q":6.5217,"op_qoq":-16.6667,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":66.6667,"rev_yoy":-1.7094,"op_trend_4q":43.9024,"fin_period":"202605","roe":7.37,"debt_ratio":30.01,"per":4.97,"pbr":0.34,"div_yield":null